# PHASE 2: FIX THE FOUR KNOWN LIVE ISSUES (reproduce first, then fix)

The app is live at `dob-hub.ai.studio`. These four problems were reported on the live site. For each: find the root cause, show the evidence, fix it, and report the exact widths/browsers tested.

## 2.1 Mobile layout overflow on the admin dashboard
- Reproduce at 320, 360, 390, 412, 768 widths as an admin. Add a temporary dev-only detector (remove before release) that logs every element whose right edge exceeds `document.documentElement.clientWidth`, and report the offenders (tables, `min-w-*`, fixed pixel widths, `100vw`/`w-screen`, long unbreakable strings such as emails or handles, `whitespace-nowrap` rows, wide grids, charts).
- Fix the cause, not the symptom: `min-w-0` on flex/grid children, `overflow-x-auto` on a dedicated container around wide tables (so only the table scrolls, never the page), `flex-wrap`, `break-words` / `truncate` with a title attribute, responsive grid columns. Do not hide the problem with a blanket `overflow-x: hidden` on `body`. Remove any `100vw` that includes the scrollbar.
